{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Post Tool - Continue Work (Token Optimized)",
  "description": "Sau khi execute tools, verify nhanh và tiếp tục. Không dài dòng, không reports.",
  "version": "2.0",
  "when": {
    "type": "postToolUse",
    "toolTypes": ["write", "shell"]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "⚡ POST TOOL - QUICK VERIFY & CONTINUE\n\n**Tool executed. Verify và tiếp tục!**\n\n---\n\n## 1️⃣ QUICK VERIFY (5 seconds)\n\n- Tool result: Success/Error?\n- Any blockers?\n- Tests passing?\n\n---\n\n## 2️⃣ CONTINUE IMMEDIATELY\n\n**Current task done?**\n- ✅ YES → Move to next subtask\n- ⏳ NO → Continue current task\n\n**Any blockers?**\n- ❌ YES → Fix now\n- ✅ NO → Continue\n\n---\n\n## 🚫 RULES\n\n- ❌ NO long analysis\n- ❌ NO reports\n- ❌ NO meetings\n- ✅ Quick verify (1 sentence)\n- ✅ Continue immediately\n\n---\n\n**CONTINUE NOW!**"
  }
}
